13378-                <tr id="item-sheet-30-2-3"><td><a class="item-no" href="#pin-sheet-30-2-3"><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!B81">2-3</span></a></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!E81">分割先商品コード</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!M81">○</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!P81">数値</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!T81">○</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!V81">255</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!Z81">ABCD1234</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0202" data-excel-sheet="在庫分割CSV登録" data-excel-ref="0202:在庫分割CSV登録!AG81">在庫分割先の商品コードを記入</span></td></tr>
